Package: imagefilterproject
Title: Filter your images to a grey, red, green or blue scale
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person(given = "Basile", family = "Dalarun", 
    email = "basile.dalarun@ki.se", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: With this package you have the functions to upload some JPEG images from your
    working directory, and apply different color filters to it. You can choose to have it
    in shades of grey, red, green or blue.
